{"id": 10003440, "reference": "A12/00446/21", "publication_date": "2021-04-28T12:30:20.810Z", "modification_date": "2021-04-28T12:30:20.811Z", "country": "Sweden", "product_category": "KITCHEN_COOKING_ACCESSORIES", "product_name": "Kettle", "product_name_specific": "Vattenkokare", "risk_description": "The plastic material of the product contains short chain chlorinated paraffins (SCCPs) and an excessive amount of bis(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP) (measured values up to 4.83 % and 2.85 % by weight, respectively). \nThe metal solder in the product contains an excessive amount of lead (measured value up to: 0.21 % by weight).\nSCCPs persist in the environment, are toxic to aquatic organisms at low concentrations and bioaccumulate in wildlife and humans, posing a risk to human health and the environment.\nLead poses a risk to the environment and is harmful to human health, as it accumulates in the body, can cause developmental neurotoxicity and may affect breast-fed or unborn children. Phthalates may harm the health of children, causing possible damage to their reproductive system.", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with REACH, with the requirements of the Commission Directive on the restriction of the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment (RoHS 2 Directive) and of the Regulation on persistent organic polutants (POP Regulation).", "country_of_origin": "People's Republic of China", "sold_online": "NO", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Marado"], "model_types": ["KET-3/WDF-2323"], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL", "ENVIRONMENT"], "measures": ["PRODUCT_RECALL_FROM_CONSUMERS"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10027217, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10027218, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}